            "review_title": "Review at Hai San Sam Son",
            "review_text": "meenu_patnaik\nBhubaneswar, India33 contributions\n0\nEat like locals do !\nDec 2019 • Family\nThis is not a place frequented by tourists but very popular amongst locals . Decor is very simple but hygiene is good . Waiters understand very basic English . We had to take help of translator app to order food . But all the effort is worth it cause the food is fantastic . The seafood is very very fresh and prawns grilled in salt are out of the world . \nWorth a visit if you want taste of local cuisine .\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 29, 2019",
