            "review_text": "PhilthetravellerXI\nAvoca Beach, Australia864 contributions\n0\nVery good seafood.\nMar 2018 • Business\nThis nice restaurant specialises in seafood and the fish is fresh - we had rainbow trout which was brought to the table for us to preview before being prepared. The spring rolls were very good and the salads fresh and tasty. It offers a nice ambience but is some way out of town, you’d really want to be staying locally. It has large tables good for a group as we were and working locally. Service was very good and prices reasonable\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten March 27, 2018",
